### Default URL
GET http://localhost:5000/

### Default API URL
GET http://localhost:5000/api/

### Register a user
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "jane@example.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

### Login and copy the token from the response
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "jane@example.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

### New route contact controller
GET http://localhost:5000/api/contacts
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### route get contact id (getContactById)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/contacts/6ac8af15b5b244ebe29826e2
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### post contacts (addContact)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/contacts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <token>

{
    "name": "Jane Smith",
    "age": 25
}
### put contacts id (updateContact)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/contacts/6ac8af15b5b244ebe29826e2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <token>

{
    "name": "Papin Jacob",
    "age": 67
}

### delete contacts id (removeContact)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/contacts/6ac8af15b5b244ebe29826e2
Authorization: Bearer <token>